# Networking task

Task: Using nftables, add a firewall rule that accepts incoming TCP connections on port `{{tcp_port}}`. The rule must be active in the running ruleset, must be loaded automatically at boot through the nftables service, and its configuration must live in `/etc/nftables.conf` or in a file included from it.

Do not add any rule that blocks or restricts SSH access on port 22, and do not change the policy of existing chains to drop.
